        array("id" => "s2e5", "season" => 2, "number" => 5, "name" => "Enter the Oración Seis!", "airdate" => "8 Nov 2010", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "The coalition of conjurers gathers at their meeting place to discuss their plan to stop Oracion Seis. But when the allies are ambushed, the crew get a taste of the evil prowess they're up against!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742372.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e6", "season" => 2, "number" => 6, "name" => "Maiden of the Sky", "airdate" => "15 Nov 2010", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "With Erza slowly being poisoned to death, Carla reveals that Wendy's powers as a Sky Dragon Slayer can heal Erza, which sends everyone off to rescue their friends. However, Natsu, Gray, and Carla are inhibited by members of the dark guild Naked Mummy.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742373.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e7", "season" => 2, "number" => 7, "name" => "The Girl and the Ghost", "airdate" => "22 Nov 2010", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Frightened and conflicted, Wendy is coerced into bringing an evil wizard - whom she remembers fondly - back from the brink of death. Meanwhile, Natsu and Gray are sidelined by some monkey business when a goofy guild stands in their way to save Wendy!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742374.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e8", "season" => 2, "number" => 8, "name" => "Dead Grand Prix", "airdate" => "29 Nov 2010", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "With Wendy and Carla in tow, Natsu and Gray rush to heal their friend, but they're sidetrack by an attack from a deceptively quick member of Oracion Seis! Rival ice wizards team up in a high-speed battle to put the brakes on Racer.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742375.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e9", "season" => 2, "number" => 9, "name" => "Darkness", "airdate" => "6 Dec 2010", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "The sixth member of Oracion Seis finally awakens from his slumber. When Erza is finally back to full strength, she rushes to find Jellal and stop him before he releases the chaotic power of Nirvana!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742376.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e10", "season" => 2, "number" => 10, "name" => "Celestial Skirmish", "airdate" => "13 Dec 2010", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Lucy goes solo against an identity thief who has her own celestial powers - but she can't compare when it comes to the coalition member's compassion for her companions in combat! Nirvana already starts to take effect on the wizards within its radius.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742377.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e11", "season" => 2, "number" => 11, "name" => "Jellal of Days Gone By", "airdate" => "20 Dec 2010", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Angel is defeated and Lucy together with Natsu end up falling down a giant waterfall, where they reunite with Gray, Lyon, and Sherry. Wendy reveals to Carla her past concerning Jellal and how she came to Cait Shelter. Meanwhile, Erza finds an amnesiac Jellal…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742378.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e12", "season" => 2, "number" => 12, "name" => "March of Destruction", "airdate" => "27 Dec 2010", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Erza puts her heart into convincing Jellal to cancel the self-destruction spell, but Brain is two steps ahead of them. When Nirvana morphs into an ancient city on legs and targets an unsuspecting guild, Natsu and Happy fight Cobra to try to stop it!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742379.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e13", "season" => 2, "number" => 13, "name" => "Super Aerial Battle! Natsu vs. Cobra", "airdate" => "3 Jan 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As the ancient city of Nirvana continues its path towards Cait Shelter, Natsu and Happy take a pounding from Cobra's poisonous strikes. But the power of a true dragon slayer should never be underestimated - as long as Happy can keep him off the ground!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742380.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e14", "season" => 2, "number" => 14, "name" => "Wizard Saint Jura", "airdate" => "17 Jan 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Jura's strength is rock solid as he steps up to shut Brain down. Meanwhile, Natsu and Happy are sick as dogs under the effects of Cobra's poison, and Nirvana's march has the fire wizard floored - unless some Sky magic can fix him!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742381.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e15", "season" => 2, "number" => 15, "name" => "Your Words", "airdate" => "24 Jan 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "There's still one Oracion Seis member left standing, and Nirvana doesn't show any signs of stopping! They have to defeat Midnight and a talking staff! Erza and Jellal try their hand at cracking the sorcerer's mirror magic, but things get ugly quick.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742382.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e16", "season" => 2, "number" => 16, "name" => "Zero", "airdate" => "31 Jan 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Erza uses sheer force and battle smarts to see straight through Midnight's illusions in a mind-warping fight to the finish. But when the last of the six generals drops, the guild master's super destructive split personality breaks free!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742383.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e17", "season" => 2, "number" => 17, "name" => "From Pegasus to Fairies", "airdate" => "7 Feb 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As Zero fires on Cait Shelter, Blue Pegasus's ship Christina, held together by Lyon, Sherry, and Ren, destroy one of Nirvana's legs and cause it to miss. Hibiki relays the details of the plan to stop Nirvana: within 20 minutes, the six legs of Nirvana must be…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742384.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e18", "season" => 2, "number" => 18, "name" => "The Power of Feelings", "airdate" => "14 Feb 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The coalition coordinates a team attack to end Nirvana's course of destruction. But before they can make their final strike, Natsu faces Zero in a fierce battle to the finish! Will an old enemy get in the way, or lend a helping hand?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742385.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e19", "season" => 2, "number" => 19, "name" => "I'm With You", "airdate" => "21 Feb 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Not even being sent to a land of nothingness can keep the power of the dragon down as Natsu fully unleashes a newfound power! Now the team can attack Nirvana with a unified strike! But what happens when another force comes after their new friends?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742386.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e20", "season" => 2, "number" => 20, "name" => "A Guild for One", "airdate" => "28 Feb 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Agents from the Magic Council dispatched to the site of Nirvana's fall arrest Jellal; when everyone else resists, Erza stops them and urges the officials to take Jellal away, though she is devastated by the outcome.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742387.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e21", "season" => 2, "number" => 21, "name" => "Call of the Dragon", "airdate" => "7 Mar 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The coalition parts ways and Fairy Tail welcomes their newest members to the guild! Then, Gray informs Natsu about a lady who claims she met a dragon recently. With hopes of finding their long lost guardian, two Dragon Slayers end up at a creepy hotel.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742388.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e22", "season" => 2, "number" => 22, "name" => "Natsu vs. Gray!", "airdate" => "14 Mar 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Duped by his rival and a strange saleswoman, Natsu finds himself in fiery fisticuffs against a very unlikely foe! Erza and Lucy know something's up, but they have some scaly copycats to handle before they can help their friend out of a bind!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742389.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e23", "season" => 2, "number" => 23, "name" => "Friendship Overcomes the Dead", "airdate" => "21 Mar 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "With Natsu trapped inside her magic-sapping monstrosity, Daphne flies straight for Fairy Tail! As the guild fights to protect Magnolia from annihilation, Makarov gives Gray the third degree.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742390.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e24", "season" => 2, "number" => 24, "name" => "A Fairy Tail Wizard", "airdate" => "28 Mar 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The only wizard who can defeat the rampaging Dragonoid is inside the Dragonoid. Since Gray's plan didn't pan out like he hoped, Fairy Tail's only hope is to get Natsu fired up enough to get himself out of the hot seat!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742391.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e25", "season" => 2, "number" => 25, "name" => "Rainbow Cherry Blossoms", "airdate" => "4 Apr 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "It's cherry blossom season in Magnolia, and Fairy Tail is preparing for a huge celebration. No one's as excited as Lucy, but when she catches a cold on a mission, she finds herself alone during the festivities and reflects on her time in the guild.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742392.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e26", "season" => 2, "number" => 26, "name" => "Wendy's First Big Job!?", "airdate" => "11 Apr 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Wendy takes her first big assignment--one that sends her to the theater where Natsu and the others once performed in a disastrous play. Happy and Freed are assigned to help her out, but a few other wizards can't help but tag along.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742393.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e27", "season" => 2, "number" => 27, "name" => "24-Hour Endurance Road Race", "airdate" => "16 Apr 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The wizards go head to head as the guild competes in an endurance race where anything goes (except flying magic). Will anyone be able to beat Jet, the reigning champion? And what's the terrible punishment for the loser that Makarov keeps talking about?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742394.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e28", "season" => 2, "number" => 28, "name" => "Gildarts", "airdate" => "23 Apr 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Gildarts--Fairy Tail's strongest wizard--returns from a hundred-year quest that even he couldn't complete. After remembering more peaceful times when Lisanna was still alive, Natsu visits Gildarts and discovers that the wizard has seen a black dragon.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742395.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e29", "season" => 2, "number" => 29, "name" => "Earthland", "airdate" => "30 Apr 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Mystogan's secret identity is revealed to Wendy and Carla as a powerful magic transports Fairy Tail--along with the rest of Magnolia--to another world. What does this other realm want with the wizards, and how are Happy and Carla involved?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742397.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e30", "season" => 2, "number" => 30, "name" => "Edolas", "airdate" => "7 May 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu and the few remaining wizards travel to the world of Edolas in an attempt to rescue the captured city of Magnolia. It's a place where nothing is as it seems and magic is scarce. Plus, there's something strangely familiar about the people there...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742398.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e31", "season" => 2, "number" => 31, "name" => "Fairy Hunter", "airdate" => "14 May 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The Fairy Tail in the parallel plane of Edolas is full of guild mates who act the exact opposite of their earth counterparts. Lucy is a tough-as-nails leader, Erza is a vicious enemy of the wizards, and Carla and Happy seem to be worshipped--and feared.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742399.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e32", "season" => 2, "number" => 32, "name" => "Key of Hope", "airdate" => "21 May 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu and his team travel to the black market in order to gear up with some magical contraband. There, the scary version of Lucy comes face to face with the normal version of Lucy, who just might be the only person in Edolas who can use magic.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742400.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e33", "season" => 2, "number" => 33, "name" => "Fireball", "airdate" => "28 May 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As the kingdom of Edolas gets closer to draining magic from the captured city of Magnolia, Natsu meets a bizarro version of himself--one who's only at home behind the wheel of a car. Meanwhile, Gajeel and his Edolas doppelganger get along swimmingly.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742401.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e34", "season" => 2, "number" => 34, "name" => "Welcome Home", "airdate" => "4 Jun 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu's team arrives in the capital city and discovers that the entire town of Magnolia has been turned into a giant crystal. After Carla helps them come up with a plan, they attempt to infiltrate the palace--with disastrous consequences.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742402.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e35", "season" => 2, "number" => 35, "name" => "Extalia", "airdate" => "11 Jun 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After a terrible betrayal, Lucy, Natsu, and Wendy are imprisoned beneath the palace. Meanwhile, Carla and Happy discover a world of cats just like them. There, they learn the truth about their duty, and their lives are revealed to be full of lies.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742403.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e36", "season" => 2, "number" => 36, "name" => "Fly, to Our Friends!", "airdate" => "18 Jun 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After turning their backs on their homeland, Carla and Happy search for a way to save their friends. On a small farm, they meet some fellow Exceeds who may have more in common with Happy and Carla than the Fairy Tail cats realize.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742404.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e37", "season" => 2, "number" => 37, "name" => "Code ETD", "airdate" => "25 Jun 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Happy and Carla manage to rescue Lucy from the Edolas version of Erza, only to be chased by an army of Exceeds. As the dragon slayers are drained of their power in the dungeons, the king activates Code ETD and starts an unexpected rebellion.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742405.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e38", "season" => 2, "number" => 38, "name" => "Erza vs. Erza", "airdate" => "2 Jul 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The Royal Army's true intentions are revealed! Meanwhile, a few familiar faces show up to save Wendy and Natsu. When the Edolas version of Erza meets Earth's Erza, a fierce, no-holds-barred battle begins.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742406.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e39", "season" => 2, "number" => 39, "name" => "We're Talking About Lives Here!!!!", "airdate" => "9 Jul 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu, Gray, and Lucy face off against members of the Royal Army in an insane amusement park full of lethal rides and swarms of monsters. Elsewhere, Panther Lily faces off against Gajeel in the sky.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742407.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e40", "season" => 2, "number" => 40, "name" => "For Pride's Sake, the River of Stars", "airdate" => "16 Jul 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When Lucy goes head-to-head with an old man who is able to turn into a giant, tentacled monster, Virgo gives her a new weapon. Meanwhile, Gray fights for the key to the army's destructive weapon.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742408.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e41", "season" => 2, "number" => 41, "name" => "The Apocalyptic Dragon Chain Cannon", "airdate" => "23 Jul 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Wendy and Carla visit Extalia to warn the queen of the cat-filled city's impending doom, but are met with a violent welcome. Natsu and Gray plot to use the Royal Army's own weapons against them--but are captured by Erza.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742409.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e42", "season" => 2, "number" => 42, "name" => "The Boy Back Then", "airdate" => "30 Jul 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As everyone unites to try to stop the Fairy Tail lacrima from crashing into Extalia, Queen Chagot makes a shocking admission and the truth behind the Exceeds is revealed! Will anyone be able to stop the Royal Army's plot?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742410.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e43", "season" => 2, "number" => 43, "name" => "Dragon Sense", "airdate" => "6 Aug 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As Panther Lily recovers from a devastating attack, Erza Knightwalker sends her forces after the Exceeds. The king attacks from within an armored dragon that absorbs magic power. Luckily, there are a few dragon slayers around.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742411.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e44", "season" => 2, "number" => 44, "name" => "O Living Ones", "airdate" => "13 Aug 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Two Erzas fight each other in the ruins of Extalia! The king's dragon armor takes a terrifying new form! And as the Royal Army closes in on Lucy and the others, the Edolas Fairy Tail must decide whose side they're on!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742412.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e45", "season" => 2, "number" => 45, "name" => "I'm Standing Right Here", "airdate" => "20 Aug 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The dragon slayers continue to fight, joining forces in a devastating combo attack. But even if the king is defeated, Mystogan has enacted a plan that will forever change Edolas, and could mean big things for Panther Lilly.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742413.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e46", "season" => 2, "number" => 46, "name" => "Bye-bye, Edolas", "airdate" => "27 Aug 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As all the magic is sucked out of Edolas, the public panics, and three unlikely villains set about trashing the city. It looks like Fairy Tail will finally be transported back to their world--but not everyone will be returning with them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742414.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e47", "season" => 2, "number" => 47, "name" => "Lisanna", "airdate" => "3 Sep 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The guild finally returns to Earthland--along with a few other surprises. The Exceeds make it their mission to track down all their missing children, Gajeel gets a new partner, and a long-lost guild member makes a shocking return.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742415.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e48", "season" => 2, "number" => 48, "name" => "He Who Extinguishes Life", "airdate" => "10 Sep 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Rebuilding begins in the plane of Edolas as everyone tries to figure out what to do now that there is no magic left in the world. Back in Magnolia, Fairy Tail celebrates the return of Lisanna as the magic council debates the guild's future.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742416.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 3, "name" => "Season 3", "rating" => 9.5, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s3e1", "season" => 3, "number" => 1, "name" => "Best Partners", "airdate" => "17 Sep 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu, Gray, Juvia, Elfman, Cana, Fried, Levy, and Mystogan's disciple Mest are selected to participate in Fairy Tail's annual S-Class promotion exam, and are instructed to choose a partner to accompany them during the exam.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742417.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e2", "season" => 3, "number" => 2, "name" => "Who's the Lucky One?", "airdate" => "24 Sep 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The exam participants arrive at Sirius Island, Fairy Tail's sacred ground, where they each take one of eight routes that will lead to the next stage of the exam. Most of these routes either pit the participants against each other or one of Fairy Tail's S-Clas…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742418.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e3", "season" => 3, "number" => 3, "name" => "Natsu vs. Gildarts", "airdate" => "1 Oct 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Juvia and Lisanna are pitted against Erza, while Elfman and Evergreen are pitted against Mirajane. Meanwhile, Natsu enthusiastically fights Gildarts, with a series of flashbacks detailing how Natsu had never once been able to defeat him since childhood.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742419.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e4", "season" => 3, "number" => 4, "name" => "Mest", "airdate" => "8 Oct 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Guild members begin to wonder about Mest, who has a peculiar place in their memories. Meanwhile, only five duos are left in the exam as the second trial begins and the wizards are tasked with finding the grave of Fairy Tail's founding guild master.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742420.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e5", "season" => 3, "number" => 5, "name" => "Black Wizard", "airdate" => "15 Oct 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu attacks the black-haired youth to no effect, causing the youth to despair that Natsu is not strong enough to defeat him. The youth unleashes another wave of deadly magic against Natsu and disappears, but Natsu is protected from the attack by his scarf,…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742421.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e6", "season" => 3, "number" => 6, "name" => "Iron Soul", "airdate" => "22 Oct 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Gajeel and Levy fight Kawazu and Yomazu, who reveal that they are scouting the island to kill the Fairy Tail wizards. Though seriously wounded, Gajeel sends Levy to warn their guildmates of Grimoire Heart's attack.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742422.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e7", "season" => 3, "number" => 7, "name" => "Makarov Charges", "airdate" => "29 Oct 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "While being interrogated, Mest rescues Wendy from an attack by Azuma, one of the Seven Kin. Mest reveals himself to be a Magic Council agent named Doranbalt, sent to search for incriminating evidence against Fairy Tail and disband it.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742423.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e8", "season" => 3, "number" => 8, "name" => "Lost Magic", "airdate" => "5 Nov 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Makarov is defeated and gravely wounded in his battle against Hades, which is sensed by the wandering Laxus. Meanwhile, the other members of Fairy Tail battle Grimoire Heart's army.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742424.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e9", "season" => 3, "number" => 9, "name" => "Fire Dragon vs. Flame God", "airdate" => "12 Nov 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu is overwhelmed by Zancrow's God Slayer magic, which proves superior to his own Dragon Slayer magic.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742425.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e10", "season" => 3, "number" => 10, "name" => "Grand Magic World", "airdate" => "19 Nov 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Azuma learns of Mirajane's former identity as the \"Demon\" and straps Lisanna to a time bomb so he can fight Mirajane at full strength.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742426.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e11", "season" => 3, "number" => 11, "name" => "Arc of Embodiment", "airdate" => "26 Nov 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Elfman and Evergreen are overwhelmed and defeated by Rustyrose's Arc of Incarnation, which gives him the power to create anything from his imagination. Meanwhile, Loke realizes Caprico is the celestial spirit Capricorn, and that he has the power to take contr…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742427.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e12", "season" => 3, "number" => 12, "name" => "Human Gate", "airdate" => "3 Dec 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Caprico reveals himself to be a human named Zoldio who fused with Capricorn using his Human Subordination magic. He possesses Loke, but Loke gives his Regulus ring to the newly freed Capricorn.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742428.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e13", "season" => 3, "number" => 13, "name" => "Lucy Fire!", "airdate" => "10 Dec 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Lucy and Hikaru's battle interrupts Natsu's battle with Ultear, leading Natsu to help Lucy and reform their old team while Ultear leaves with Zeref.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742429.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e14", "season" => 3, "number" => 14, "name" => "Dead-end of Despair", "airdate" => "17 Dec 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Doranbalt tries to help Natsu and his friends evacuate the island as the Magic Council plans to fire Etherion once again, but they refuse to leave. Meanwhile, Juvia is nearly defeated during her and Erza's battle against Merudy of the Seven Kin.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742430.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e15", "season" => 3, "number" => 15, "name" => "Tears of Love and Vitality", "airdate" => "24 Dec 2011", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When Gray, Juvia, and a Grimoire Heart wizard are linked together by a dark magic, one wrong move could mean the death of all three of them. Meanwhile, Ultear's past is revealed as she confronts Gray--the one she holds responsible for her mother's death.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742431.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e16", "season" => 3, "number" => 16, "name" => "The One Thing I Couldn't Say", "airdate" => "7 Jan 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Cana discovers the grave of Mavis, Fairy Tail's founding master. After thinking about her troubled past--and connection the Gildarts--she receives the powerful spell Fairy Glitter. But even this magic might not be enough to take out Grimoire Heart.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742432.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e17", "season" => 3, "number" => 17, "name" => "Tenrou Tree", "airdate" => "14 Jan 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The guild continues to take on the members of Grimoire Heart as Erza goes head-to-head with Azuma. But when the dark wizard becomes one with the island flora, a secret magic is revealed and the island itself falls into peril.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742433.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e18", "season" => 3, "number" => 18, "name" => "Erza vs. Azuma", "airdate" => "21 Jan 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "With all the magic suddenly drained from their bodies, the wizards of Fairy Tail are powerless against their enemies. Their lives depend on one guild mate--Erza--but even she might not have the strength to save them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742434.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e19", "season" => 3, "number" => 19, "name" => "Freezing Fighting Spirit", "airdate" => "28 Jan 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The battle against Grimoire Heart continues as everyone's power suddenly returns! Gray vows to stop the dark guild using Iced Shell--sacrificing himself in the process--at the suggestion of Ultear, his former-teacher's daughter.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742435.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e20", "season" => 3, "number" => 20, "name" => "Power of Life", "airdate" => "4 Feb 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After confirming her treachery, Gray take on Ultear, channeling the memory of his former teacher in a dangerous attempt to defeat the time-altering wizard. But as Ultear's history comes to light, it's more complicated than even she realizes.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742436.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e21", "season" => 3, "number" => 21, "name" => "Rolling Thunder", "airdate" => "11 Feb 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The guild splits up into teams in order to strike back against Grimoire Heart, taking the fight straight to Hades. Elsewhere on the island, Zeref's power is unleashed, taking out members from both sides of the battle.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742437.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e22", "season" => 3, "number" => 22, "name" => "The Man Without an Emblem", "airdate" => "18 Feb 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Several members of the Dark Guild Grimoire Heart are back for revenge after their magic power has restored, and they're after the wounded Fairy Tail members. The remaining Fairy Tail members will have to hold them off if they are to protect their friends. Mea…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/35/89563.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e23", "season" => 3, "number" => 23, "name" => "Realm of the Abyss", "airdate" => "25 Feb 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "The Fairy Tail members left at the camp deal with the remaining Grimoire Heart forces. At the same time, Natsu uses the magical powers of Laxus battle Hades once again. Thunder-Fire dragon hunter versus Grimoire Heart's master.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/36/91519.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e24", "season" => 3, "number" => 24, "name" => "Daybreak on Tenrou Island", "airdate" => "3 Mar 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Even after Natsu wasn't able to defeat Master Hades using his own powers and the powers leant to him by Laxus, the Fairy Tail members won't give up without a final fight. While Master Hades pulls out all the stops, Natsu, Lucy, Erza, Grey and Wendy face him h…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/36/91520.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e25", "season" => 3, "number" => 25, "name" => "The Right to Love", "airdate" => "10 Mar 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "The battle between Fairy Tail and the dark guild Grimoire Heart has come to it's conclusion and as the dust settles Fairy Tail members are left to wonder: what of the S-Class exam? Even though she hasn't made S-Class yet, Cana decides to tell Gildarts the tru…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/36/91521.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e26", "season" => 3, "number" => 26, "name" => "Let's Hold Hands", "airdate" => "17 Mar 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The Fairy Tail's members on Tenrou Island can't even catch their breath after winning the all-out war with the dark guild Grimoire Heart as the ancient and mysterious dragon Acnologia suddenly appears above Tenrou Island. Gildarts, having faced the dragon bef…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/36/91955.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e27", "season" => 3, "number" => 27, "name" => "Fairy Tail, Year X791", "airdate" => "24 Mar 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Seven years have passed since Acnologia attacked and destroyed Tenrou Island. The Fairy Tail members that were present haven't been seen since and in their absence the strongest guild on Earth and it's members have been through a lot of changes.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/36/91958.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e28", "season" => 3, "number" => 28, "name" => "The Seven Year Gap", "airdate" => "31 Mar 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The Fairy Tail members that went missing on Tenrou Island 7 years ago are back. But a lot has changed in 7 years, and picking up where they left off will not be so easy.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/36/91959.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e29", "season" => 3, "number" => 29, "name" => "The Magic Ball", "airdate" => "7 Apr 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu, Happy, Lucy, Erza, Grey, Wendy and Carla go on a mission that requires them to go to an elegant ball for mages to capture jewel thief.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/37/94115.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e30", "season" => 3, "number" => 30, "name" => "True Scoundrels - The Butt Jiggle Gang", "airdate" => "14 Apr 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu, Happy, Lucy, Wendy and Carla are looking for an easy score when they take a mission to protect cargo travelling 6 hours by train for potential thieves. But when the weird gang of thieves actually strike, Natsu is down for the count due to motion sickne…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/37/94116.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e31", "season" => 3, "number" => 31, "name" => "The Terror of Invisible Lucy", "airdate" => "21 Apr 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Lucy uses a 7 year old potion whilst taking a bath. But it seems that 7 years is a lot, even for a magic potion, and the effect turns Lucy invisible. Fun at first, it puts her in quite the predicament and she hopes her fellow Fairy Tail members can help her t…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/37/94114.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e32", "season" => 3, "number" => 32, "name" => "Father's Memento", "airdate" => "28 Apr 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Everyone in the guild is surprised when suddenly Michelle, a relative of Lucy appears, carrying a mysterious memento of Lucy's father. Michelle is invited to stay at the guild for a while and joins Team Natsu on a simple quest.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/37/94137.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e33", "season" => 3, "number" => 33, "name" => "Turbulent Showdown! Natsu vs. Laxus", "airdate" => "5 May 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu and Gajeel challenge Laxus to a duel. The guild and the town of Magnolia immediately organise an entire festival around the event, since it has been seven years something noteworthy like that has happened. Even though Natsu and Gajeel have increased in…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/37/94425.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e34", "season" => 3, "number" => 34, "name" => "Target: Lucy", "airdate" => "12 May 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After the duel between Natsu and Laxus, Fairy Tail members return to the Guild only to encounter three mysterious wizards there. The wizards, who are the Earthland counterparts of Edolas' Coco, Sugar boy and Hughes, are demanding that the guild hands over Luc…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/37/94426.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e35", "season" => 3, "number" => 35, "name" => "The Fury of Legion", "airdate" => "19 May 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The battle between Earthland's Sugar boy, Hughes, Coco and Fairy Tail rages on. Meanwhile Gildarts faces off with Earthland's Byro, where he finds out that Fairy Tail is facing a secret mage order called the Legion Corps.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/37/94427.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e36", "season" => 3, "number" => 36, "name" => "Key of the Starry Heavens", "airdate" => "26 May 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As the dust settles and Fairy Tail recovers from their kind-of-a-defeat by the hand of the Legion, Team Natsu decides they won't give up so easily and head to the Heartfilia mansion to search for clues concerning the clock hand that the Legion stole from Lucy.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742227.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e37", "season" => 3, "number" => 37, "name" => "Travel Companions", "airdate" => "2 Jun 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "By studying the book from the Heartfilia library, Lucy discovers that there are five more clock pieces hidden throughout the world. Fairy Tail splits up to hunt them down before the Legion can, and the groups run into strange characters on the road.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742439.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e38", "season" => 3, "number" => 38, "name" => "Labyrinth Capriccio", "airdate" => "9 Jun 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natus and Lucy's expedition team discovers a strange gateway in the middle of the desert that leads to a dangerous underground dungeon. Elsewhere, Gray's team discovers a puzzle-filled cave--and Sugar Boy.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742441.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e39", "season" => 3, "number" => 39, "name" => "Footprints of the Myth", "airdate" => "16 Jun 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu team runs into two members of the Legion Corps in the underground dungeon. Lucy gets shrunk, Happy becomes a giant, and the only way for the wizards to prevail might be through really bad smells and...marriage?!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742444.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e40", "season" => 3, "number" => 40, "name" => "True Scoundrels, Once Again", "airdate" => "23 Jun 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The Butt Jiggle Gang is back and they're dead-set on finding one of the mysterious clock parts before Fairy Tail does. In order to get ahead of them, Erza dons one of their skintight black uniforms and teaches them the meaning of true villainy.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742446.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e41", "season" => 3, "number" => 41, "name" => "Defying Calculation", "airdate" => "30 Jun 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As the Fairy Tail expedition teams continue to discover clock components, Legion Corps ramps up its assault against the guild. When Samuel and Pantherlily go head to head, it's an Exceed battle like the wizards have never seen before.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742447.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e42", "season" => 3, "number" => 42, "name" => "The Course of the Holy War", "airdate" => "7 Jul 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "One of Legion's members manages to separate Mirajane's demon form from her body and uses it to attack the wizard's family! Meanwhile, the secret order's crusade finally comes to light along with the terrifying truth behind the infinity clock.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742448.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e43", "season" => 3, "number" => 43, "name" => "Time Begins to Tick", "airdate" => "14 Jul 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu's team of wizards goes head-to-head with Byro, a powerful adversary with the power to nullify magic attacks. Elsewhere, the members of Zentopia grow restless as the Archbishop's condition continues to worsen.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742449.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e44", "season" => 3, "number" => 44, "name" => "Enter the Neo-Oración Seis!", "airdate" => "21 Jul 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "One of Fairy Tail's most powerful enemies--Oracion Seis--has been reborn, and the members are now deadlier than ever. When they show up demanding the Infinity Clock, will anyone be able to stand in their way?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742450.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e45", "season" => 3, "number" => 45, "name" => "Get the Infinity Clock!", "airdate" => "28 Jul 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As Fairy Tail recovers from their encounter with the new Oracian Seis, Kinana enters a trance-like state and carves something in an ancient language into the walls of the guild. Meanwhile, the Legion Platoon gets a strange new member.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742451.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e46", "season" => 3, "number" => 46, "name" => "Dissonance of Battle", "airdate" => "4 Aug 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Lahar tracks down a jaded Doranbolt--who now goes by Mest--at a pub, Laki and Gildarts discover a creepy set of nuns, and Fairy Tail's newest teams face off against members of the new Oracion Seis (along with some members of the Legion Platoon).", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742452.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e47", "season" => 3, "number" => 47, "name" => "Anti-Link", "airdate" => "11 Aug 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As Fairy Tail and Legion Platoon wizards face off with members of the reborn Oracion Seis, Mest and Lahar discover a Celestial Wizard named Katja who has important information about Zentopia--and a connection to Will Neville.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742453.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e48", "season" => 3, "number" => 48, "name" => "Despair Unleashed", "airdate" => "18 Aug 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Now that it's been confirmed the new Oración Seis is actually targeting select Celestial Wizards and not churches, the truth about Michelle is revealed. As the Infinity Clock begins to work, it's catastrophic magic blackens the sky.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742454.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e49", "season" => 3, "number" => 49, "name" => "Real Nightmare", "airdate" => "25 Aug 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Archaeologists show up at the guild's headquarters with background on Jude Heartfilia and the Infinity Clock--as well as a powerful evil-vanquishing hammer. Meanwhile, Natsu tries to escape a magical prison with the help of...the Butt Jiggle Gang?!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742455.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e50", "season" => 3, "number" => 50, "name" => "Time Spiral", "airdate" => "1 Sep 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As the Infinity Clock's powers begin to activate, the world descends into chaos. Fairy Tail's special team heads to the Infinity Clock, where Lucy is being prepared as a sacrifice. Meanwhile, the deep corruption within Zentopia is finally exposed.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742456.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e51", "season" => 3, "number" => 51, "name" => "To the Infinity Castle!", "airdate" => "8 Sep 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The Legion Platoon turns their sights on Lucy, vowing to destroy her in order to save the rest of the world from the Infinity Clock. As Wendy tries to heal the Archbishop, Happy comes up with a plan that could save Lucy, but time is running out.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742457.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e52", "season" => 3, "number" => 52, "name" => "Angel Tears", "airdate" => "15 Sep 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The Infinity Clock's magic continues to wreak havoc on the world as a handful of Fairy Tail wizards make a last-chance effort to save Lucy and stop the Real Nightmare. Four members of Oración Seis must be defeated, but can Gray defeat a host of angels?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742458.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e53", "season" => 3, "number" => 53, "name" => "I Hear the Voice of My Friend", "airdate" => "22 Sep 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Three dark wizards must be defeated to save the world, but Lucy's body has almost completely merged with the Infinity Clock. When the Archbishop wakes, he's able to explain how the clock operates, and how Fairy Tail might stall the Real Nightmare.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742459.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e54", "season" => 3, "number" => 54, "name" => "Lucy and Michelle", "airdate" => "29 Sep 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As Lucy becomes one with the Infinity Clock, she finds herself floating in a realm of memories. There, she comes to terms with who--or what--Michelle is, and the role the girl played in her past. In the end, they may be the only ones able to save the world.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742460.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 4, "name" => "Season 4", "rating" => 7.8, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s4e1", "season" => 4, "number" => 1, "name" => "Sabertooth", "airdate" => "6 Oct 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Former enemies make amends and Fairy Tail continues to try to repair its reputation as the Fiore Kingdom reels from recent crises. Meanwhile, the Legion Platoon is given a new mission, and Makarov shows Gildarts the guild's greatest secret.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743574.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e2", "season" => 4, "number" => 2, "name" => "And So We Aim for the Top", "airdate" => "13 Oct 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu unleashes an electrifying new move! Inspired, the guild goes in search of a way to increase their magic power without actually putting in the work of training. Meanwhile, leadership of the guild changes hands...more than once.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743575.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e3", "season" => 4, "number" => 3, "name" => "Song of the Stars", "airdate" => "20 Oct 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As Natsu and the gang prepare for the Grand Magic Games, Lucy gets an alarming call from Virgo. She leads them to the Celestial Spirit World, where they come across a great surprise.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743576.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e4", "season" => 4, "number" => 4, "name" => "For All the Time We Missed Each Other", "airdate" => "27 Oct 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "As guilds across the Fiore Kingdom prepare for the games, three powerful enemies from Fairy Tail's past show up and ask the guild for a favor. In return, they offer Natsu and his teammates a painful power-up that will take their magic to the next level.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743577.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e5", "season" => 4, "number" => 5, "name" => "Crocus, the Flower-Blooming Capital", "airdate" => "3 Nov 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Fairy Tail's five representatives for the Grand Magic Games are chosen! But trouble follows the guild to the capital of the Fiore Kingdom, and if all the reps aren't back to their assigned inn by midnight, they may be out before the games even begin.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743578.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e6", "season" => 4, "number" => 6, "name" => "Sky Labyrinth", "airdate" => "10 Nov 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The first elimination challenge has begun, and representatives from Fairy Tail have to navigate a giant labyrinth in the sky quickly if they want to be one of the guilds that move on to the next round. The only problem? One of their members is missing.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743579.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e7", "season" => 4, "number" => 7, "name" => "New Guild", "airdate" => "17 Nov 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Having barely qualified to continue in the Grand Magic Games, one of Fairy Tail's representatives has to be replaced. As the competing guilds are introduced, Natsu and the others size up their competition--which includes an unexpected set of foes.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743580.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e8", "season" => 4, "number" => 8, "name" => "Night of Shooting Stars", "airdate" => "24 Nov 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The Grand Magic Games have begun! Gray represents one of Fairy Tail's teams on the first day of the competition in a magical hide-and-seek challenge carried out in a playing field full of multiple copies of the contestants.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743581.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e9", "season" => 4, "number" => 9, "name" => "Lucy vs. Flare", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Raven Tail has been picking on Fairy Tail from the beginning, but now that Lucy is up against one of their wizards--Flare--the guilds are truly going head-to-head! Whichever wizard gets knocked out first loses, but just what is the dark guild after?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743583.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e10", "season" => 4, "number" => 10, "name" => "Portent", "airdate" => "8 Dec 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The battles continue as wizards from the competing guilds go spell-for-spell in the stadium center. When Jellal-as-Mystogan takes on a member of Lamia Scale, will he be able to make up for all of Fairy Tail's previous losses?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743584.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e11", "season" => 4, "number" => 11, "name" => "Chariots", "airdate" => "15 Dec 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After being completely annihilated on the first day of the Grand Magic Games, Fairy Tail tries to recover and keep high spirits for the remaining rounds. Elsewhere, the captain of the guard is up to something suspicious, and Carla has a terrible vision.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743585.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e12", "season" => 4, "number" => 12, "name" => "Elfman vs. Bacchus", "airdate" => "22 Dec 2012", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Elfman takes center stage as he fights a talented martial artist--and unveils a powerful new beast form! Meanwhile, Raven Tail continues to bully the other guilds, and two of Fairy Tail's members are kidnapped from the infirmary.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743586.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e13", "season" => 4, "number" => 13, "name" => "Mirajane vs. Jenny", "airdate" => "5 Jan 2013", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "A battle between Mirajane and a pinup model from Blue Pegasus turns into a knock-down-drag-out fight of sexy poses and costume changes. As the arena fills with bikini-clad wizards, a dark plot against one of Fairy Tail's members unfolds behind the scenes.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743587.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e14", "season" => 4, "number" => 14, "name" => "Kagura vs. Yukino", "airdate" => "12 Jan 2013", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As the second day of the Grand Magic Games draws to a close, an epic fight between Sabertooth's powerful celestial wizard and Mermaid Heel's leaping swordswoman rocks the stadium. Later, Erza comes across a spritely figure from her past.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743589.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e15", "season" => 4, "number" => 15, "name" => "Hatred at Nightfall", "airdate" => "19 Jan 2013", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After losing her battle against a member of Mermaid Heel, Yukino gets kicked out of Sabertooth. Distraught, she pays a visit to Fairy Tail, where she offers Lucy a valuable gift and gets Natsu all fired up.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743590.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e16", "season" => 4, "number" => 16, "name" => "Pandemonium", "airdate" => "26 Jan 2013", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After Natsu punches out Dobengal, the guild member summoned to fight him, he and Jiemma engage in a duel. However, the guild master's daughter Minerva appears.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743591.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e17", "season" => 4, "number" => 17, "name" => "100 Against 1", "airdate" => "2 Feb 2013", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Erza kills the 100 monsters using various types of armor to match their strength and weaknesses.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743592.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e18", "season" => 4, "number" => 18, "name" => "Laxus vs. Alexei", "airdate" => "9 Feb 2013", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As the battles continue to rage in the Grand Magic Games, an ancient magic is performed in the stadium. Later, Laxus takes on Raven Tail-his father's guild-but there's much more to this epic match than meets the eye.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743593.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e19", "season" => 4, "number" => 19, "name" => "Wendy vs. Shelia", "airdate" => "16 Feb 2013", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After Laxus defeats Ivan and the four Raven Tail elite members, Ivan's illusions disappear to the shock of everyone in the stadium. Later, Wendy of Fairy Tail Team A and Sherria Blendy of Team Lamia Scale face off to compete for the final match of the day.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743594.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e20", "season" => 4, "number" => 20, "name" => "Small Fists", "airdate" => "23 Feb 2013", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "With Cheria being fully healed and Wendy being almost depleted of magic power, their battle continues, with the former casting a high-level spell towards the latter. However, it seems that Wendy enhances Cheria's physical strength, causing the attack to gain…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743595.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e21", "season" => 4, "number" => 21, "name" => "Naval Battle", "airdate" => "2 Mar 2013", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "As the jubilant Fairy Tail members celebrate their victories, the other people, such as Sting, Kagura, and Milliana, are contemplating on their own concerns, while Yukino is enlisted as a sergeant under Arcadios' command. Meanwhile, the fourth day of the comp…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743597.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e22", "season" => 4, "number" => 22, "name" => "A Parfum for You", "airdate" => "9 Mar 2013", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "While Lucy is hospitalized and taken to the infirmary, the Fairy Tail members warn Saber Tooth that they have angered the worst possible guild to do so. Later, Makarov announces that the two Fairy Tail teams must merge as a result of the disqualification of R…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743598.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e23", "season" => 4, "number" => 23, "name" => "Battle of Dragon Slayers", "airdate" => "16 Mar 2013", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Mermaid Heel's Kagura and Milliana and Lamia Scale's Lyon and Yuka face off for the second tag battle of the games. For the third and final match of the day, the spectators look on in silence as Natsu and Gajeel of Team Fairy Tail and Sting and Rogue of Team…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743600.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e24", "season" => 4, "number" => 24, "name" => "Four Dragons", "airdate" => "23 Mar 2013", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "The tag battle continues, with Sting and Rogue beginning to attack Natsu and Gajeel with their powers being increased.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743601.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e25", "season" => 4, "number" => 25, "name" => "Natsu vs. The Twin Dragons", "airdate" => "30 Mar 2013", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 6.7, "summary" => "The tag battle of the Dragon Slayers comes to a close, with Natsu overpowering the combined attacks of Sting and Rogue. The Saber Tooth members watch in dismay, while Jiemma seethes in anger.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/297/743604.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 5, "name" => "Season 5", "rating" => 8.2, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s5e1", "season" => 5, "number" => 1, "name" => "King of the Dragons", "airdate" => "5 Apr 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Following Sting and Rogue's defeat, Ziemma furiously attempts to expel the two from Saber Tooth. When Lector defends Sting, Ziemma seemingly kills him, prompting Sting to blast the guild master through the chest.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808462.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e2", "season" => 5, "number" => 2, "name" => "The Eclipse Project", "airdate" => "12 Apr 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Arcadios reveals the details of the top-secret Eclipse Project to Natsu and friends, but things quickly go awry when Lucy is taken into custody.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808465.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e3", "season" => 5, "number" => 3, "name" => "Fairy Tactician", "airdate" => "19 Apr 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Mavis reveals her incredible skill as a strategist as the final event of the Grand Magic Games begins. Meanwhile, Natsu's squad tries to rescue Lucy.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808481.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e4", "season" => 5, "number" => 4, "name" => "Gray vs. Rufus", "airdate" => "26 Apr 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Gray squares off against Rufus in a Make magic rematch. Meanwhile, Natsu and friends devise a unique way to escape from their imprisonment.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808482.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e5", "season" => 5, "number" => 5, "name" => "The Hungry Wolf Knights", "airdate" => "3 May 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Sabertooth has a new master. And Fairy Tail may be on top of the Grand Magic Games, but below the palace, Natsu and the others are still trapped in Palace Hell. And then things get worse when the hunters become the hunted - by the Garou Knights.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808483.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e6", "season" => 5, "number" => 6, "name" => "Fairy Tail vs. Executioners", "airdate" => "10 May 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Though their appearances may be foolish, the Garou Knights are the strongest executioners in the kingdom. And now, the members of Fairy Tail's \"away team\" are separated from each other and forced into one-on-one combat against the knights.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808485.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e7", "season" => 5, "number" => 7, "name" => "Scorching Earth", "airdate" => "17 May 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Lucy and Yukino team up and use their celestial spirits to battle the powerful Uosuke.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808486.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e8", "season" => 5, "number" => 8, "name" => "Our Place", "airdate" => "24 May 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu and friends teach the Hungry Wolf Knights who's boss, once and for all.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808487.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e9", "season" => 5, "number" => 9, "name" => "The Kingdom 'til Tomorrow", "airdate" => "31 May 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Erza, Kagura, and Minerva face each other in an unpredictable, three-way battle. Meanwhile, Natsu and friends make an unexpected encounter.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808489.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e10", "season" => 5, "number" => 10, "name" => "Erza vs. Kagura", "airdate" => "7 Jun 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Future Lucy collapses and is taken in by Natsu's team, while Princess Hisui and Jellal ponder over the upcoming calamity. Meanwhile, as Gajeel and Laxus square off against Rogue and Olga, respectively, Minerva pits Erza and Kagura against each other before le…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808490.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e11", "season" => 5, "number" => 11, "name" => "A Future Racing Toward Despair", "airdate" => "14 Jun 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "The battle between Erza and Kagura comes to a surprising end. Meanwhile, Future Lucy reveals the horrific incident that will soon unfold.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808491.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e12", "season" => 5, "number" => 12, "name" => "Frog", "airdate" => "21 Jun 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Gajeel and Rogue face off in an unusual, surprising battle. Future Lucy puts her knowledge of events to good use, but something still seems strange.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808506.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e13", "season" => 5, "number" => 13, "name" => "Roaring Thunder!", "airdate" => "28 Jun 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Using his new shadow powers, Gajeel overpowers and finally defeats the possessed Rogue. The shadow exits Rogue's body, erasing his memory of the fight.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808507.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e14", "season" => 5, "number" => 14, "name" => "Gloria", "airdate" => "5 Jul 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The final battle of the Grand Magic Games is about to come to an end, but Fairy Tail faces one last foe.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808509.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e15", "season" => 5, "number" => 15, "name" => "The One Who Closes the Gate", "airdate" => "12 Jul 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Jellal makes an unexpected realization about Future Lucy. Meanwhile, Natsu and friends come face-to-face with the same revelation.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808511.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e16", "season" => 5, "number" => 16, "name" => "Natsu vs. Rogue", "airdate" => "19 Jul 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "All the guild wizards in Crocus unite to defend Fiore from the looming dragon threat. Elsewhere, Natsu battles the future version of Rogue.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808649.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e17", "season" => 5, "number" => 17, "name" => "For Me, Too", "airdate" => "26 Jul 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The guild wizards must face the ferocious dragons in battle while Lucy struggles to shut the Eclipse gate.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808651.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e18", "season" => 5, "number" => 18, "name" => "Seven Dragons", "airdate" => "2 Aug 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Fairy Tail and the other guilds face an impossible task: defeat the seven dragons that came through the Eclipse gate.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808652.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e19", "season" => 5, "number" => 19, "name" => "Zirconis' Magic", "airdate" => "9 Aug 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As the dragons' assault intensifies, Zirconis unleashes a surprising new spell. Meanwhile, Natsu continues to struggle against Future Rogue.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808653.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e20", "season" => 5, "number" => 20, "name" => "People and People, Dragons and Dragons, People and Dragons", "airdate" => "16 Aug 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu jumps onto the back of the fire dragon Atlas Flame and begins eating the flames covering his body. Back in Crocus, Rogue Learn that his future self is responsible for the attack on Crocus. Ultear plots to kill Rogue.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808664.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e21", "season" => 5, "number" => 21, "name" => "Sin and Sacrifice", "airdate" => "23 Aug 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Millianna finally confronts Jellal in the middle of the war-torn city. Elsewhere, the battle against the smaller dragons takes a drastic turn.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808665.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e22", "season" => 5, "number" => 22, "name" => "Time of Life", "airdate" => "30 Aug 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Ultear uses her ultimate time-manipulation spell to try to undo recent events - but at great cost.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808667.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e23", "season" => 5, "number" => 23, "name" => "Fields of Gold", "airdate" => "6 Sep 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The Fairy Tail wizards focus all their power on the Eclipse gate in a last-ditch effort to destroy it and change the future.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808668.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e24", "season" => 5, "number" => 24, "name" => "The Grand Banquet", "airdate" => "13 Sep 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The King throws a ball to celebrate the end of the battle.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808669.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e25", "season" => 5, "number" => 25, "name" => "Droplets of Time", "airdate" => "20 Sep 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The fairy tail members start heading home. Dorenbolt wipes the memory of the council to hide the battle with dragons. Jellal and Meldy are looking for Ultear when a mysterious elderly lady gives them a letter from her.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808670.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e26", "season" => 5, "number" => 26, "name" => "A Gift", "airdate" => "27 Sep 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Upon returning home, Fairy Tail receives a gift from the Mayor. Natsu, Lucy and Happy accept a job to get rid of a monster.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808671.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e27", "season" => 5, "number" => 27, "name" => "Welcome Back, Frosch", "airdate" => "4 Oct 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Frosch goes missing when shopping with Lector and is determined to make it back to Sabertooth by himself, bumping into various members of other guilds along the way. The members of Sabertooth cheer him on from the sidelines.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808684.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e28", "season" => 5, "number" => 28, "name" => "Moulin Rouge", "airdate" => "11 Oct 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When Erza sees a white cue ball used in playing billiards, she tells her story of her first experience in billiards and her first encounter with Moulin Rogue.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808686.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e29", "season" => 5, "number" => 29, "name" => "Full Effort Hospitality!", "airdate" => "18 Oct 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As thanks for helping them close the Eclipse Gate, Lucy and Yukino invite each of their celestial spirits to Star Hill to grant each of them a wish.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808687.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e30", "season" => 5, "number" => 30, "name" => "Signal of Rebellion", "airdate" => "25 Oct 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Lucy and Yukino are unable to summon their Zodiac celestial spirits. A change in the celestial spirit world causes the Zodiac spirits to lose their memories and their personalities change.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808689.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e31", "season" => 5, "number" => 31, "name" => "Library Panic", "airdate" => "1 Nov 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Fairy Tail split into teams to do research on the Liberam. As usual Natsu does not follow the plan and sneaks into the spirit world alone. Virgo attacks the library where Lucy, Levy and Yukino are.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808692.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e32", "season" => 5, "number" => 32, "name" => "Hisui Rises!", "airdate" => "8 Nov 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The Princess and Arcadios reveal the reason behind the changes in the spirit world and give them a way to force-close zodiac gates. Natsu, Lucy, Levy and Yukino fight against Pisces.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808694.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e33", "season" => 5, "number" => 33, "name" => "Astral Spiritus", "airdate" => "15 Nov 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu's team interrupts the zodiac's Liberam ritual and a fight ensues. The rest of Fairy Tail arrives to back them up. They follow the zodiac spirits into the rift between the human and celestial worlds. Elfman battles Taurus.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808696.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e34", "season" => 5, "number" => 34, "name" => "Wendy vs. Aquarius - Let's Have Fun in the Amusement Park!", "airdate" => "22 Nov 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Cana battles Cancer in a card game while Wendy and Aquarius play at the amusement park. Natsu joins Wendy after Loke knocks him into the amusement park.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808697.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e35", "season" => 5, "number" => 35, "name" => "Guild Deck vs. Celestial Deck", "airdate" => "29 Nov 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "While Cana continues to battle Cancer in a card game, Levy faces Capricorn in a trivia quiz and Mirajane fights Pisces in an underwater battle.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808699.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e36", "season" => 5, "number" => 36, "name" => "Gray vs. Cancer - Dance Battle!", "airdate" => "6 Dec 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Gray and Cancer dance off in a battle.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808702.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e37", "season" => 5, "number" => 37, "name" => "Juvia vs. Aries! Desert Death Match!", "airdate" => "13 Dec 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Levy must make a confession to win the trivia quiz against Capricorn, and Natsu and Wendy run into the snake charmer celestial spirit, Ophiuchus. Meanwhile, Juvia struggles to fight Aries in the desert.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808703.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e38", "season" => 5, "number" => 38, "name" => "Erza vs. Sagittarius! Horseback Showdown!", "airdate" => "20 Dec 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Gajeel and Panther Lily are transformed into small animals by Gemini during their battle with the twin spirits, but Gajeel eventually discovers he can still use his magic and easily knocks them out. Meanwhile, Sagittarius challenges Erza to three horseriding…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808704.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e39", "season" => 5, "number" => 39, "name" => "Natsu vs. Leo", "airdate" => "27 Dec 2014", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Loke re-starts the Liberam ritual. Natsu fight him while Wendy, Happy and Charle try to steal the celestial globe.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808706.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e40", "season" => 5, "number" => 40, "name" => "Ophiuchus, the Snake Charmer", "airdate" => "10 Jan 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu and Arcadios fight Ophiuchus. Natsu combines the twelve celestial realms so Lucy and Yukino must stop Virgo and Libra together. It is revealed the closure of the spirits' gates was all apart of the Celestial Spirit King's plan.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808707.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e41", "season" => 5, "number" => 41, "name" => "When the Stars Fall", "airdate" => "17 Jan 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu's group continues to fight against Ophiuchus, but her weapon proves difficult to beat. The rest of Fairy Tail figure out a way to stop the Astral Spiritus.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808709.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e42", "season" => 5, "number" => 42, "name" => "Celestial Spirit Beast", "airdate" => "24 Jan 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Although Ophiuchus was defeated, the ritual wasn't stopped in time. Fairy Tail enters the celestial spirit world to prevent its destruction. They're faced with the Eclipse Celestial Spirit King, who begins to turn them into constellations.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808710.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e43", "season" => 5, "number" => 43, "name" => "Believe", "airdate" => "31 Jan 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu enters the Celestial Beast to free the Celestial King and spirits. After the Clestial Spirit World is saved, the spirits lose their memories of the events and return to normal.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808711.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e44", "season" => 5, "number" => 44, "name" => "What a Pure Heart Weaves", "airdate" => "7 Feb 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu looks after Asca for a day while Bisca and Alzack are on a job.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808719.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e45", "season" => 5, "number" => 45, "name" => "413 Days", "airdate" => "14 Feb 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "It is the 413th day since Juvia met Gray. She asks the guild members what would make the perfect anniversary gift for him.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808720.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e46", "season" => 5, "number" => 46, "name" => "The Labyrinth of White", "airdate" => "21 Feb 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu, Lucy and Happy travel up Mt. Hakobe to get special Hakobe ice. They become lost in a living cave and run out of food.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808723.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e47", "season" => 5, "number" => 47, "name" => "Transform!", "airdate" => "28 Feb 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu and Lucy try to learn transformation magic. Macao and Wakaba also try to learn but become monsters. Erza, Gajeel and Lily become superheroes and must defeat them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808724.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e48", "season" => 5, "number" => 48, "name" => "It's Kemo-Kemo!", "airdate" => "7 Mar 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When an egg falls from the sky, Natsu decides to raise it. Fairy Tail participants in a student exchange program between guilds, so Natsu, Lucy, Gray and Erza decide to go to find out more about the mystery animal.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808726.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e49", "season" => 5, "number" => 49, "name" => "The Place You Came To", "airdate" => "14 Mar 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After an island emerges from the sea, a Fairy-Sabertooth coalition is formed to find the source of the mysterious life signs that the Magic Council detected. Kemo-Kemo remembers his purpose.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808727.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e50", "season" => 5, "number" => 50, "name" => "Lightning Man", "airdate" => "21 Mar 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "A town plagued by lightening asks for Laxus' help. It is thought Laxus may be the cause of their problem.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808728.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e51", "season" => 5, "number" => 51, "name" => "Fairy Tail of the Dead Meeeeeeeeen", "airdate" => "28 Mar 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "A potion created by Sir Ichiya pollutes Magnolia and turns its residents into Ichiya zombies.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/323/808730.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 6, "name" => "Season 6", "rating" => 9.3, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s6e1", "season" => 6, "number" => 1, "name" => "Morning of a New Adventure", "airdate" => "4 Apr 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Natsu and Gray go on a mission together. When they take longer than expected, Erza, Lucy and Wendy check up on them. When they return, Natsu and Gray receive a job request from a Saint Wizard.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834586.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e2", "season" => 6, "number" => 2, "name" => "Wizards vs. Hunters", "airdate" => "11 Apr 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu's team arrive at Sun Village, a village that has entirely frozen over - including its people. They run into a treasure hunter guild called Sylph Labyrinth who are trying to steal the Eternal Flame.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834588.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e3", "season" => 6, "number" => 3, "name" => "Art of Regression", "airdate" => "18 Apr 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Erza turns into a child while trying to find the Eternal Flame and runs into Minerva, who has joined a dark guild. Natsu is also turned into a child by Doriate. Lucy and Wendy fight the treasure hunters and are saved by Flare.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834589.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e4", "season" => 6, "number" => 4, "name" => "The Demon Returns", "airdate" => "25 Apr 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Lucy, Wendy and Flare fight the treasure hunters. Erza fights Minerva but her powers have been extremely reduced. While Natsu is trying to locate the source of the voice he heard, Gray is turned into a child and fights Doriate.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834590.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e5", "season" => 6, "number" => 5, "name" => "Gray vs. Doriate", "airdate" => "2 May 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Although Gray's magic power has decreased, his tactical skills have not, and he outwits Doriate. Doriate loses control and transforms into a demon, turning the remaining people on the island into children.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834591.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e6", "season" => 6, "number" => 6, "name" => "Voice of the Flame", "airdate" => "9 May 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu fights a monster while Gray tries to thaw the Eternal Flame, but when the ice melts, only a small flame remains. Natsu ignites the flame with his fire power, and discovers who the voice he heard belongs to.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834592.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e7", "season" => 6, "number" => 7, "name" => "Song of the Fairies", "airdate" => "16 May 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After the village is saved, it is revealed the Silver Demon Slayer mistook the Eternal Flame for a demon and froze it along with the village. The group spends an evening at a hidden hot-springs with the Wizard Saint Warrod.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834593.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e8", "season" => 6, "number" => 8, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter, Prologue - The Nine Demon Gates", "airdate" => "23 May 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Peace has returned to the Fairy Tail guild, but trouble is brewing for the Magic Council. At long last, the powerful Tartaros dark guild springs into action with full force!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834594.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e9", "season" => 6, "number" => 9, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter, Prologue - Fairies vs. Netherworld", "airdate" => "30 May 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Laxus fights a mysterious and powerful Tartaros enemy who's out to kill an old Council member. And, after everything that's happened, Fairy Tail declares war on Tartaros!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834595.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e10", "season" => 6, "number" => 10, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter, Prologue - The White Legacy", "airdate" => "6 Jun 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Jackal is bent on taking the life of former Council member Michello, but Fairy Tail stands in the way. Natsu and friends try to stop Jackal, but quickly learn that they're facing no ordinary foe!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834596.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e11", "season" => 6, "number" => 11, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter, Prologue - Natsu vs. Jackal", "airdate" => "13 Jun 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Multiple Fairy Tail teams rush to protect former Council members from the deadly Tartaros guild. But things look bleak even for Natsu's team...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834597.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e12", "season" => 6, "number" => 12, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Immorality and Sinners", "airdate" => "20 Jun 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Erza and Mirajane rush to protect Crawford, the former Magic Council chairman. Meanwhile, Doranbolt frees the Oración Seis, and Natsu has a shocking realization about Tartaros...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834598.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e13", "season" => 6, "number" => 13, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Jellal vs. Oración Seis", "airdate" => "27 Jun 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu and Happy find where the Tartaros guild has been hiding! Happy rushes to alert the rest of Fairy Tail, but little does anyone know that an unexpected trap has been set. Elsewhere, Jellal singlehandedly fights the members of Oración Seis.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834599.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e14", "season" => 6, "number" => 14, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - A Place Reached by Prayer", "airdate" => "4 Jul 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Jellal's life is the final key to unsealing the devastating Face weapon. But Tartaros is bent on finding him, and the Oración Seis already have him in dire straits...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834600.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e15", "season" => 6, "number" => 15, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - The Demon's Rebirth", "airdate" => "11 Jul 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Elfman's attempt to blow up Fairy Tail reaches its explosive conclusion! Elsewhere, Lummy begins to transform Mirajane into a hideous creation meant to do Tartaros' bidding. This looks like the end for the Fairy Tail guild!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834601.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e16", "season" => 6, "number" => 16, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - To Let Live or Die", "airdate" => "18 Jul 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The legendary Zeref has a special one-on-one meeting with Natsu. Other members of Fairy Tail discover that the terrifying Face weapon has been activated. They quickly set out to stop it, but they meet with heavy resistance!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834602.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e17", "season" => 6, "number" => 17, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Wendy vs. Ezel", "airdate" => "25 Jul 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu must fight a demon that can absorb other beings' souls and take their form... including one of a surprising character! Elsewhere, Wendy and Carla rush to stop the Face from detonating, but they're greeted by a formidable foe.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834603.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e18", "season" => 6, "number" => 18, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Friends Forever", "airdate" => "1 Aug 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Wendy has unleashed a new power from within herself, but can she master it in time to stop the doomsday Face weapon?! And what of Natsu and friends, as they face a grotesque version of the almighty Master Hades?!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834604.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e19", "season" => 6, "number" => 19, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Hell's Core", "airdate" => "8 Aug 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After the secret of Tartaros' strength is revealed, Mirajane and Seilah face off in an intense battle. The only problem: they're immune to each other's powers! Meanwhile, Erza reunites with an old foe with new strength...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834605.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e20", "season" => 6, "number" => 20, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Underworld King", "airdate" => "15 Aug 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Rustyrose of Grimoire Heart suddenly appears before Jellal, Meldy, and the Oración Seis. He shares his encounter with Tartaros' formidable Kyoka... but things aren't quite what they seem.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834606.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e21", "season" => 6, "number" => 21, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Alegria", "airdate" => "22 Aug 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Mirajane struggles against the demon Seilah, whose full potential has been unleashed. Elsewhere, the Underworld King takes control of the chaotic situation by showing everyone who's boss!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834607.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e22", "season" => 6, "number" => 22, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - A Strike from the Stars", "airdate" => "29 Aug 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Everyone in Fairy Tail has fallen victim to Mard Geer's Alegria technique... except for Lucy. Unfortunately, that means she must face off with the mighty Tartaros guild all alone!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834608.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e23", "season" => 6, "number" => 23, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Celestial Spirit King vs. Underworld King", "airdate" => "5 Sep 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Out of strength and on the verge of defeat, Lucy makes a great sacrifice to summon the Celestial Spirit King. Tartaros' base is quickly decimated, and soon the Celestial Spirit King and the Underworld King reunite...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834609.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e24", "season" => 6, "number" => 24, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Erza vs. Minerva", "airdate" => "12 Sep 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Wendy and Carla learn the full truth of Tartaros' Face plan, and it's not good. Elsewhere, Erza faces off with Minerva, who has undergone a demonic transformation. At last, their final showdown is at hand!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834610.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e25", "season" => 6, "number" => 25, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - The Boy's Tale", "airdate" => "19 Sep 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Sabertooth members arrive to lend backup in the war against Tartaros! While Erza rushes to find the guild's control room, Gray learns the shocking truth about Silver...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834611.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e26", "season" => 6, "number" => 26, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Gray vs. Silver", "airdate" => "26 Sep 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Juvia continues to battle with the enigmatic Keyes. Elsewhere, Gray faces off with Silver in a showdown that's been ten long years in the making!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834612.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e27", "season" => 6, "number" => 27, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - A Silver Wish", "airdate" => "3 Oct 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Silver reveals his true past to Gray once and for all and Juvia is tasked with defeating Keyes to stop the Faces and save the day.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834613.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e28", "season" => 6, "number" => 28, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Air", "airdate" => "10 Oct 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "While Natsu and Gajeel are fighting their opponents, a mysterious black water begins to flood the grounds and saps their strength. One by one they start to pass out, with Gajeel's iron skin the only thing keeping him conscious.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834616.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e29", "season" => 6, "number" => 29, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Steel", "airdate" => "17 Oct 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Levy gives Gajeel air and he finally unleashes the strength to defeat Torafuzar. Laxus returns for a rematch against Tempester, but he is hiding something.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834633.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e30", "season" => 6, "number" => 30, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Final Duels", "airdate" => "24 Oct 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Laxus' battle intensifies and he has one last trick up his sleeve to put Tempester down for good, but will Erza's group make it to the control room in time to stop face from activating?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834636.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e31", "season" => 6, "number" => 31, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Wings of Despair", "airdate" => "31 Oct 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Kyoka absorbs Selia's power, and she and Erza begin their battle. The guild is shocked by the arrival of past foe looking to destroy E.N.D., and Natsu hears Igneel call out to him.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834637.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e32", "season" => 6, "number" => 32, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Fire Dragon Iron Fist", "airdate" => "7 Nov 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Igneel fights Achnologia and tasks Natsu with stealing the Book of E.N.D. from the King of the underworld. Kyoka forms a living link with the Face activation device in order to speed up the process.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834638.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e33", "season" => 6, "number" => 33, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - 00:00", "airdate" => "14 Nov 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Kyoka breaks through all of Erza's armors and takes away her 5 senses. Will Erza still be able to beat her before Face activates?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834639.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e34", "season" => 6, "number" => 34, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - The Girl in the Crystal", "airdate" => "21 Nov 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Natsu, Sting, and Rogue struggle against the Underworld King. Master Macarov reveals the ace that has been kept a secret among the masters of Fairy Tail.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834640.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e35", "season" => 6, "number" => 35, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Absolute Demon", "airdate" => "28 Nov 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Mard Geer reveals why Zeref created the demons. Gray shows off his new powers but is struck down by Jiemma, who has been transformed into a demon.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834641.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e36", "season" => 6, "number" => 36, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Memento Mori", "airdate" => "5 Dec 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Sting and Rogue take down Jiemma. The battle between Mard Geer and Natsu and Gray rages on, until Mard unleashes a curse called memento Mori.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834642.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e37", "season" => 6, "number" => 37, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Soaring Above Ishgar", "airdate" => "12 Dec 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The other guilds begin attacking the faces but to no avail. Gray and Natsu take down Mard Geer, but face has already activated. Will the appearance of surprise allies turn the tide of the battle?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834643.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e38", "season" => 6, "number" => 38, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter - Drops of Fire", "airdate" => "19 Dec 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "In this epilogue to the Tartaros saga, the dragons reveal a tragic secret to Fairy Tail, while Natsu makes a vow to Igneel's fading soul. In the aftermath, Makarov dissolves the guild, several members set out on their own quests, and Zeref drops a shocking re…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834644.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e39", "season" => 6, "number" => 39, "name" => "Tartaros Chapter, Finale - Where the Power of Life Lies", "airdate" => "26 Dec 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Dorenbalt wipes the memories of the guild members, and another revelation is made about Dorenbalt. Macarov decides to disband the guild while members go on journeys to become stronger.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834656.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 7, "name" => "Fairy Tail Zero", "rating" => null, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s7e1", "season" => 7, "number" => 1, "name" => "The Fairy in Your Heart", "airdate" => "9 Jan 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After aimlessly wondering around for a week, Natsu and Happy go to Tenrou Island on a pilgrimage. Flashback to 100 years ago, an orphaned Mavis works at a guild who are then attacked by a rival guild.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834669.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e2", "season" => 7, "number" => 2, "name" => "The Adventure Begins", "airdate" => "16 Jan 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Mavis encounters treasure hunter Yuri Dreyar on Tenroujima and accepts his mind game challenge over the Tenrou Jade. This eventually leads to the beginning of a journey, but will Mavis's oldest and only friend Zera agree to go?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834671.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e3", "season" => 7, "number" => 3, "name" => "Treasure Hunt", "airdate" => "23 Jan 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "With no wind, the ship isn't going any where. Mavis takes advantage of the situation and explores and underwater shrine, but she runs into trouble.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834672.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e4", "season" => 7, "number" => 4, "name" => "Dancing with Blades", "airdate" => "30 Jan 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The crew finally arrives in Hargeon. Mavis and Precht go searching for information when they come across a shady bar.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834675.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e5", "season" => 7, "number" => 5, "name" => "Moonlit Lake", "airdate" => "6 Feb 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Yuri and Warrod argue, and Precht tells the story of when they tried to find the rainbow flower. A nasty surprise is waiting for them in Magnolia.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834677.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e6", "season" => 7, "number" => 6, "name" => "Blue Skull", "airdate" => "13 Feb 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The group finds that Magnolia has been taken over by Blue Skull. When they fight, the Master sees through Mavis's illusions, rendering her magic useless against them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834679.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e7", "season" => 7, "number" => 7, "name" => "Conveyer of Magic", "airdate" => "20 Feb 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After their defeat by Blue Skull, Mavis encounters Zeref in the forest and convinces him to teach her and the group to use magic.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834680.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e8", "season" => 7, "number" => 8, "name" => "Treasure", "airdate" => "27 Feb 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Mavis convinces the people of the town to join them and stand against Blue Skull. Yuri finds the Tenrou Orb but is cursed upon touching it.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834681.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e9", "season" => 7, "number" => 9, "name" => "Law", "airdate" => "5 Mar 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Mavis defeats the dragon using a spell Zeref taught her, but using it before mastering it comes at a price. A shocking revelation about Zera is revealed.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834682.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e10", "season" => 7, "number" => 10, "name" => "Eternal Adventure", "airdate" => "12 Mar 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Mavis says goodbye to Zera and decides what her next big adventure is going to be.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834683.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e11", "season" => 7, "number" => 11, "name" => "Challenger", "airdate" => "19 Mar 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "It has been a year since the guild dissolved, and now Lucy is an apprentice reporter for Sorcerer Weekly. She is covering the Grand Magic Games in Crocus, where an unexpected challenger infiltrates the arena.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834684.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e12", "season" => 7, "number" => 12, "name" => "Message of Flame", "airdate" => "26 Mar 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After finding that Guild is Disbanded, Natsu pulls a stunt to let everyone know Fairy Tail is back. Natsu, Lucy and Happy set out on a new adventure to return the scattered members.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/333/834685.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 8, "name" => "Season 8", "rating" => 9.3, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s8e1", "season" => 8, "number" => 1, "name" => "Lamia Scale's Thanksgiving Day", "airdate" => "6 Oct 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Natsu and Happy is reunited with Lucy one year after the dissolution of the guild. The three raise Fairy Tail rebuilding and go on a journey to find friends.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840125.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e2", "season" => 8, "number" => 2, "name" => "Because I Love You", "airdate" => "13 Oct 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "The guild Orochi's Fin launched a night raid by releasing a large group of demons on the city of Margaret. Wendy and Sheria rushed through the sky to hit the enemy's main force.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840126.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e3", "season" => 8, "number" => 3, "name" => "Avatar", "airdate" => "20 Oct 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Natsu, Lucy, Wendy, Happy and Chales meet with Juvia in Amefurashi Village and discovers that Gray disappeared.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840127.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e4", "season" => 8, "number" => 4, "name" => "Underground Fight", "airdate" => "27 Oct 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The Guild of Black Wizards Avatar, plan a strategy of purification. In search of Gray's fate, Natsu, Lucy and Happy, who find the Guild location, will attempt to infiltrate in the enemy area.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840128.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e5", "season" => 8, "number" => 5, "name" => "Purification Strategy", "airdate" => "3 Nov 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Believing that Zeref will appear at the location where several deaths will happen, the organization of the black magic, Avatar, will sacrifice an entire city. In order to stop the plan, Natsu and company run to the city of Malba.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840129.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e6", "season" => 8, "number" => 6, "name" => "Ikusa-Tsunagi", "airdate" => "10 Nov 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The main members of the Fairy Tail are reunited and behind the Black Wizards of Avatar. But the priest of the sanctuary, Arlok, is determined to do something to carry out the purification strategy.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840130.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e7", "season" => 8, "number" => 7, "name" => "Memories", "airdate" => "17 Nov 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "About 400 years ago, a boy who lost his beloved family, continued his forbidden search and was cursed by the God Ankhseram.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840131.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e8", "season" => 8, "number" => 8, "name" => "The Seventh Guild Master", "airdate" => "24 Nov 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "After receiving Lucy's letters, the former's members of Fairy Tail, gathered in Magnolia for the rebirth of the guild and the rebuilding of the building.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840132.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e9", "season" => 8, "number" => 9, "name" => "Law of Space", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Under the command of Erza, the members who discovered the truth about the dissolution of the guild, go to the mainland Alvarez to help the sixth master of the guild, Makarov.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840133.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e10", "season" => 8, "number" => 10, "name" => "Emperor Spriggan", "airdate" => "8 Dec 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Brandish, of Alvarez's Army, meets Natsu and company on the Caracole Island. Her power is so strong, that extinguishes the completely island. Meanwhile in Alvarez, the Emperor Spriggan returns to the Empire.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840134.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e11", "season" => 8, "number" => 11, "name" => "To The Land Abandoned by Gods", "airdate" => "15 Dec 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The wizards met with Makarov and now have to escape from the Alvarez Empire. However, Azir, the King of the Desert and one of the Spriggan 12 is behind them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840135.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e12", "season" => 8, "number" => 12, "name" => "Mavis and Zeref", "airdate" => "22 Dec 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Mavis finally reveals the secrets of her past, including her connection with Fairy Tail, Zeref, and her own sin. The ever-turning gears of fate offer glimpses of hope, but also produce one final, tragic contradiction.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840136.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e13", "season" => 8, "number" => 13, "name" => "Fairy Heart", "airdate" => "5 Jan 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "The \"miracle\" that Mavis and Zeref create, has evolved into a powerful form of magic that must keep in secret. Mavis is still regretful for her sin, but the wizards of the guild try to cheer her up. The Alvarez Empire prepares to approach to Ishgar.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840137.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e14", "season" => 8, "number" => 14, "name" => "The Magnolia Defensive War", "airdate" => "12 Jan 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Before the battle for Fairy Tail's existence begins, the guild members spend the final night in their own ways. But when Alvarez's vast army launches a surprise attack, Fairy Tail's bond of solidarity is put to the test.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840138.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e15", "season" => 8, "number" => 15, "name" => "Morning Star", "airdate" => "19 Jan 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Fairy Tail allowed the Spriggan 12 to invade the city of Magnolia. Lucy comes face to face with Brandish, but gets nervous when she says a name.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840139.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e16", "season" => 8, "number" => 16, "name" => "This Parfum Goes To?", "airdate" => "26 Jan 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Magnolia is threatened by another member of the Spriggan 12, Wall. Wall's next target is Fried, who is in Kardia Cathedral.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840140.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e17", "season" => 8, "number" => 17, "name" => "Natsu vs. Zeref", "airdate" => "2 Feb 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Wizard guilds all across Fiore join Fairy Tail in the battle against Zeref's armies. Meanwhile, Natsu and Happy speed off to the west to defeat Zeref once and for all.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840141.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e18", "season" => 8, "number" => 18, "name" => "Across 400 Years", "airdate" => "9 Feb 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Zeref, sensing his impending death, reveals the secret behind Natsu's birth. After learning the shocking truth, Natsu swings his fist one last time. Meanwhile, Fiore's wizard guilds begin to battle the Alvarez army and the Spriggan 12.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840142.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e19", "season" => 8, "number" => 19, "name" => "What I Want to Do", "airdate" => "16 Feb 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "While fierce fighting continued throughout Fiore, there was also a case in Magnolia's \"Fairy Tail\" guild. For the moment the crisis has left, Lucy listens to the voice of Brandish to hear the information of her mother, Leila. But for a moment, hands stained w…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840150.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e20", "season" => 8, "number" => 20, "name" => "Not Until the Battle Is Over", "airdate" => "23 Feb 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "God Serena defeats the Four Emperors of Ishgar and brings the eastern battle to its apparent conclusion. Meanwhile, Gajeel, Erza, Laxus, and other Fairy Tail members depart for different locations to support the other guilds in battle.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840153.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e21", "season" => 8, "number" => 21, "name" => "In a Silent Time", "airdate" => "3 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "While fighting Wall, Laxus is incapacitated when his Bane Particle contamination reaches a critical level. To the east, Wendy and Shelia confront \"Warrior Queen\" Dimaria of the Spriggan 12, but are instantly overwhelmed.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840154.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e22", "season" => 8, "number" => 22, "name" => "Natsu, Revived!!", "airdate" => "10 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Wendy is determined to use her Third Origin to defeat the powered-up Dimaria. But using it comes at a price: Wendy will never be able to use magic again. Meanwhile, another member of the Spriggan 12 singlehandedly attacks Fairy Tail's home base.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840156.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e23", "season" => 8, "number" => 23, "name" => "Historia of Corpses", "airdate" => "17 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Jacob unleashes his true anger after Lucy and Natsu thwart his initial plans. Eventually, he targets the other Fairy Tail members trapped in his alternate dimension. Meanwhile, the Hargeon battlefield is blanketed in darkness as a new foe appears.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840157.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e24", "season" => 8, "number" => 24, "name" => "Mettle", "airdate" => "24 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Neinhart produces Historias across the battlefield to plunge Hargeon into chaos. Past adversaries revive and attack the various guild members fighting to free the city. Erza struggles against three Historias at once, and soon finds herself immobilized.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840159.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e25", "season" => 8, "number" => 25, "name" => "The Third Seal", "airdate" => "31 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Natsu's team heads east with Brandish to negotiate with August, the Wizard King. Meanwhile, Sabertooth and Blue Pegasus spring back into action after Gajeel's team saves them. But the reinvigorated heroes face yet another nightmare.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840160.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e26", "season" => 8, "number" => 26, "name" => "Together, Always", "airdate" => "7 Apr 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Gajeel attempts to defeat the invulnerable Bloodman in a last-ditch effort to save Levy. Meanwhile, Natsu's team watches on as Brandish tries to negotiate with August. Elsewhere, Irene and Acnologia come face to face with each other.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840161.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e27", "season" => 8, "number" => 27, "name" => "Fairy Tail Zero", "airdate" => "14 Apr 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Irene's Universe One spell reshapes the entire land of Fiore. All of the wizards from Ishgar are thrown into confusion, but they work together to make progress. Meanwhile, Mavis faces a new ordeal after she regains her physical form.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840162.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e28", "season" => 8, "number" => 28, "name" => "White Dragneel", "airdate" => "21 Apr 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Mirajane defeats her two powerful adversaries, but is caught by Irene before there's time to celebrate. Elsewhere, the various Fairy Tail teams follow their own paths in order to save Mavis. But the enemy is fully prepared and waiting to stop them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840163.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e29", "season" => 8, "number" => 29, "name" => "The Winter Wizard", "airdate" => "28 Apr 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Gildarts makes a surprise return and confronts God Serena on the battlefield. Natsu and friends continue their push toward their guildhall, but soon realize how terrifying the Spriggan 12 truly are when they're fully assembled.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840164.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e30", "season" => 8, "number" => 30, "name" => "Gray and Juvia", "airdate" => "5 May 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Invel takes control of Gray and Juvia's minds. Despite being close friends, the two are forced to loathe each other and fight to the death. As the fight progresses, Juvia listens to her feelings for Gray and resists in a way only she can.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840166.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e31", "season" => 8, "number" => 31, "name" => "The Mightiest Demon of the Book of Zeref", "airdate" => "12 May 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Just as Gray learns E.N.D.'s true identity, Lucy faces off against Brandish. Lucy tries hard to avoid a fight, but her desperate pleas go unheard. With neither side willing to compromise, the ensuing battle triggers an all-new crisis.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840178.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e32", "season" => 8, "number" => 32, "name" => "Broken Bonds", "airdate" => "19 May 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Natsu and gray clash together as gray finds out about E.N.D ... on the other side guild master makarov makes a mighty move!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840179.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e33", "season" => 8, "number" => 33, "name" => "Pleasure and Pain", "airdate" => "26 May 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Erza's tears stop the fight between Gray and Natsu. Meanwhile, the remaining members of the Spriggan 12 commence a ferocious assault on Ishgar. August faces off against Crime Sorcière while Larcade unleashes an attack that affects friend and foe alike.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840182.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e34", "season" => 8, "number" => 34, "name" => "Natsu's Mind", "airdate" => "2 Jun 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Sting rushes to help as Larcade continues his relentless attack on Kagura's group. Meanwhile, Natsu falls unconscious and wakes up inside his own mind. He then revisits lost memories that shed light on his past.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840185.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e35", "season" => 8, "number" => 35, "name" => "Sting, the White Shadow Dragon", "airdate" => "9 Jun 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Sting absorbs Rogue's power and overwhelms Larcade with white and shadow magic. In response, Larcade unleashes the deadly Rest In Peace spell. Elsewhere, after an intense battle, Irene reveals a secret to Erza about her past.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840186.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e36", "season" => 8, "number" => 36, "name" => "Dragon Seed", "airdate" => "16 Jun 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Irene shares the story of her past, including the secret of Erza's birth. She also reveals the origin of Dragon Slayer magic, her connection with Zeref, and the sad fate that Dragon Slayers bear. Meanwhile, Natsu continues his journey inside his mind.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840187.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e37", "season" => 8, "number" => 37, "name" => "Master Enchant", "airdate" => "23 Jun 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Irene and Erza face each other in an epic battle. When Wendy assists Erza, Irene makes a sudden realization that spells instant doom for Wendy.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840188.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e38", "season" => 8, "number" => 38, "name" => "Dragon or Demon", "airdate" => "30 Jun 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Irene unleashes Deus Sema, a power beyond human comprehension. With only her right arm, Erza combats the spell that threatens the entire area. Meanwhile, Natsu is forced to make an important decision that will forever change his fate.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840189.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e39", "season" => 8, "number" => 39, "name" => "Gray's Trump Card", "airdate" => "7 Jul 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Magnolia reverts to its proper form after Irene's defeat. As retaliation, August prepares to destroy the town and everyone in it. Elsewhere, Gray reaches Zeref and is the first to learn about Zeref's true objective.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840190.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e40", "season" => 8, "number" => 40, "name" => "Dark Future", "airdate" => "14 Jul 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Gray makes the ultimate choice to sacrifice his life and his very existence in order to trap Zeref in ice for all eternity. Meanwhile, the mighty Acnologia finally reaches Magnolia and causes great concern for both sides of the war.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840191.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e41", "season" => 8, "number" => 41, "name" => "My Name Is...", "airdate" => "21 Jul 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "August seeks to understand the love that is shared between parent and child. When he threatens to kill Cana, Gildarts responds with rage. Meanwhile, Natsu and Zeref continue their epic battle, but a new situation develops when Larcade arrives.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840192.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e42", "season" => 8, "number" => 42, "name" => "Compassion", "airdate" => "28 Jul 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Larcade scowls in pain after Zeref rejects him as a son. Meanwhile, August begins to cast a powerful spell that threatens to destroy all of Magnolia, along with himself. Elsewhere, Erza and Wendy come face to face with the almighty Acnologia.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840193.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e43", "season" => 8, "number" => 43, "name" => "Neo Eclipse", "airdate" => "4 Aug 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Erza's team meets a mysterious woman with a plan that can completely destroy Acnologia. Meanwhile, Lucy and friends struggle to come to terms with the truth that connects Natsu's life and the Book of E.N.D. that they now hold.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840194.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e44", "season" => 8, "number" => 44, "name" => "Blind to Love", "airdate" => "11 Aug 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Anna, Blue Pegasus, and Erza's team attempt to destroy Acnologia using a hidden rift in time. Elsewhere, Zeref finally obtains everything he needs to reset time and relive his life 400 years earlier, before he turned immortal.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840195.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e45", "season" => 8, "number" => 45, "name" => "The Gate of Vows", "airdate" => "18 Aug 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Zeref obtains the power of a god - a power that transcends even time. Natsu seethes with a fiery rage as he holds the unconscious Mavis in his arms. Meanwhile, Acnologia continues to attack Blue Pegasus' ship as Anna struggles to re-open the time rift.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840196.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e46", "season" => 8, "number" => 46, "name" => "Raging Fire of the Dragon", "airdate" => "25 Aug 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Fairy Tail and Blue Pegasus continue to battle Acnologia. With the time rift now open, they're forced to make a difficult decision. In the guildhall, Natsu makes a miraculous recovery and confronts Zeref one final time.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/336/840197.jpg"),
